{"schema_version":"1.0","session_id":"ses_f9f53f420ffeLBEK8wMpYbMiwQ","team_id":"contest2026_193_FirstNext","github_login":"mfskys","tool":"opencode","seq":28,"role":"tool","ts":"2026-09-02T05:54:15.197Z","tool_name":"read","tool_call_id":"call_4936fe4576fd47be852db818","input":{"filePath":"D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\README.md"},"output":"<path>D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # hello_app — 板端 LVGL 应用（当前：AI 眼睛助手）\n2: \n3: 通过 manifest `<linkfile>` 映射到 openvela `packages/demos/contest2026_193_hello_app`。\n4: \n5: ## 文件\n6: \n7: | 文件 | 说明 |\n8: |------|------|\n9: | `eye_main.c` | **当前主程序（眼睛助手）**：两只会动的大眼睛虚拟形象 + 语音/触摸交互 |\n10: | `my_assistant_main.c` | 旧版「智能信息看板」主程序，**已弃用** |\n11: | `hello_app_main.c` | 通用 / 兼容入口 |\n12: | `Kconfig` / `Makefile` / `Make.defs` / `CMakeLists.txt` | 构建配置 |\n13: \n14: ## 编译\n15: \n16: - 启用 `CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE=y`（defconfig 已配，默认开启）\n17: - 关闭 `CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT`\n18: - 编译产物为 **`eye_app`**，由板端 `/data/startup.sh` 拉起\n19: \n20: > 凡旧文档提到 `my_assistant` 可执行文件，均为历史遗留；当前运行的是 `eye_app`。\n21: > 项目最新主线见仓库根目录 `README.md`（AI 眼睛助手），旧「智能信息看板」方案已弃用。\n\n(End of file - total 21 lines)\n</content>"}
{"schema_version":"1.0","session_id":"ses_f9f53f420ffeLBEK8wMpYbMiwQ","team_id":"contest2026_193_FirstNext","github_login":"mfskys","tool":"opencode","seq":29,"role":"tool","ts":"2026-09-02T05:54:15.197Z","tool_name":"read","tool_call_id":"call_a9c4babbaab6408592c98b5e","input":{"filePath":"D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\Kconfig"},"output":"<path>D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\Kconfig</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: #\n2: # For a description of the syntax of this configuration file,\n3: # see the file kconfig-language.txt in the NuttX tools repository.\n4: #\n5: \n6: menu \"Contest 2026 Team 193 Apps\"\n7: \n8: config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT\n9: \tbool \"OpenVela Smart Kanban (Team 193)\"\n10: \tdefault n\n11: \tdepends on GRAPHICS_LVGL\n12: \t---help---\n13: \tEnable the OpenVela kanban (Team 193): home clock + settings + real WiFi\n14: \tconnect (scan via /data/get_wifi.sh, connect via /data/wifi.cfg).\n15: \tUI logic mirrors lvgl_sim/main/src/main.c (PC preview).\n16: \n17: if LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT\n18: \n19: config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT_PRIORITY\n20: \tint \"My Assistant Task Priority\"\n21: \tdefault 100\n22: \n23: config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT_STACKSIZE\n24: \tint \"My Assistant Stack Size\"\n25: \tdefault 40960\n26: \n27: endif\n28: \n29: config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_GAME\n30: \tbool \"Pixel Monster Game Demo (Team 193)\"\n31: \tdefault n\n32: \tdepends on GRAPHICS_LVGL\n33: \t---help---\n34: \tEnable the pixel-style monster catching RPG demo:\n35: \t10x8 tile map, virtual D-Pad, turn-based battle,\n36: \tsave/load to /data/game_save.dat.\n37: \tNOTE: builds as a SEPARATE app (game_demo), not alongside kanban.\n38: \tOnly one of MY_ASSISTANT/GAME should be enabled at a time.\n39: \n40: config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE\n41: \tbool \"Robot Eye (Team 193)\"\n42: \tdefault n\n43: \tdepends on GRAPHICS_LVGL\n44: \t---help---\n45: \tEnable the robot eye (Team 193): pure black screen + two white\n46: \trounded-rect \"eyes\", 20 expressions driven by shape params,\n47: \tblink/breath, swipe down from top edge to open settings which shows\n48: \ta QR code linking to the on-device web management page (HTTP server\n49: \tinside the app, port 8080). Requires WiFi connected for the QR code.\n50: \n51: if LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE\n52: \n53: config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE_PRIORITY\n54: \tint \"Robot Eye Task Priority\"\n55: \tdefault 100\n56: \n57: config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE_STACKSIZE\n58: \tint \"Robot Eye Stack Size\"\n59: \tdefault 40960\n60: \n61: endif\n62: \n63: endmenu\n\n(End of file - total 63 lines)\n</content>"}
{"schema_version":"1.0","session_id":"ses_f9f53f420ffeLBEK8wMpYbMiwQ","team_id":"contest2026_193_FirstNext","github_login":"mfskys","tool":"opencode","seq":30,"role":"tool","ts":"2026-09-02T05:54:15.197Z","tool_name":"read","tool_call_id":"call_6cbeedc25c5d4f45a5c36eb2","input":{"filePath":"D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\Makefile"},"output":"<path>D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\Makefile</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ############################################################################\n2: # Contest 2026 team 193 - My Assistant & Game Demo\n3: ############################################################################\n4: \n5: include $(APPDIR)/Make.defs\n6: \n7: ifeq ($(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE),y)\n8: PROGNAME  = eye_app\n9: PRIORITY  = $(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE_PRIORITY)\n10: STACKSIZE = $(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE_STACKSIZE)\n11: MODULE    = $(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE)\n12: MAINSRC   = eye_main.c\n13: else\n14: ifeq ($(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_GAME),y)\n15: PROGNAME  = game_demo\n16: PRIORITY  = 100\n17: STACKSIZE = 40960\n18: MODULE    = $(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_GAME)\n19: MAINSRC   = game_demo_main.c\n20: else\n21: PROGNAME  = my_assistant\n22: PRIORITY  = $(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT_PRIORITY)\n23: STACKSIZE = $(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT_STACKSIZE)\n24: MODULE    = $(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT)\n25: MAINSRC   = my_assistant_main.c\n26: endif\n27: endif\n28: \n29: include $(APPDIR)/Application.mk\n\n(End of file - total 29 lines)\n</content>"}
{"schema_version":"1.0","session_id":"ses_f9f53f420ffeLBEK8wMpYbMiwQ","team_id":"contest2026_193_FirstNext","github_login":"mfskys","tool":"opencode","seq":31,"role":"tool","ts":"2026-09-02T05:54:15.197Z","tool_name":"read","tool_call_id":"call_fd26a75ee7cd45c8b234729b","input":{"filePath":"D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\Make.defs"},"output":"<path>D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\Make.defs</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ############################################################################\n2: # Contest 2026 team 193 - My Assistant App\n3: ############################################################################\n4: \n5: # 任一 Team193 应用被启用时, 都要把本源目录加入 apps 构建。\n6: # (原来只判断 MY_ASSISTANT, 导致 EYE / GAME 启用时目录根本不进构建)\n7: \n8: ifneq ($(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT),)\n9: CONFIGURED_APPS += $(APPDIR)/packages/demos/contest2026_193_hello_app\n10: endif\n11: \n12: ifneq ($(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE),)\n13: CONFIGURED_APPS += $(APPDIR)/packages/demos/contest2026_193_hello_app\n14: endif\n15: \n16: ifneq ($(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_GAME),)\n17: CONFIGURED_APPS += $(APPDIR)/packages/demos/contest2026_193_hello_app\n18: endif\n\n(End of file - total 18 lines)\n</content>"}
{"schema_version":"1.0","session_id":"ses_f9f53f420ffeLBEK8wMpYbMiwQ","team_id":"contest2026_193_FirstNext","github_login":"mfskys","tool":"opencode","seq":32,"role":"tool","ts":"2026-09-02T05:54:15.197Z","tool_name":"read","tool_call_id":"call_a495521b9b834e0eb305b06d","input":{"filePath":"D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\CMakeLists.txt"},"output":"<path>D:\\openvela\\contest2026_193_FirstNext\\app\\hello_app\\CMakeLists.txt</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Contest 2026 team 193 - My Assistant App\n2: if(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_MY_ASSISTANT)\n3:   nuttx_add_application(\n4:     NAME my_assistant\n5:     SRCS my_assistant_main.c\n6:     STACKSIZE 40960\n7:     PRIORITY 100\n8:     DEPENDS lvgl\n9:   )\n10: endif()\n11: \n12: if(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_193_EYE)\n13:   nuttx_add_application(\n14:     NAME eye_app\n15:     SRCS eye_main.c\n16:     STACKSIZE 40960\n17:     PRIORITY 100\n18:     DEPENDS lvgl\n19:   )\n20: endif()\n\n(End of file - total 20 lines)\n</content>"}
